  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Здравствуй, Мика! Мы рады, что ты добрался до нас. Я хочу немного рассказать тебе о нас и о том, что случилось.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "f9f2a4b3cc47fbf97a87eb6e02ea4ae8e02496abd3160bcfc3620943dee7cc86"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Когда мы впервые взглянули на небо, мы начали замечать закономерности.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "fa7793266d10a7baa63735ce6918b5c639ad9d834f7a4020bcea05b178c58163"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы построили космические корабли.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "7ec63335a2ff438a7cf245c44fd70326fc0e16c286a570b36958e4b6f71be5a5"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "И начали бороздить известную нам Вселенную.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "8aeac346ef5ad8bdcd0d0b91c5bbacb8f98e860363a0af60d39f4fb3e20567fa"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "4 / средние центральный и правый",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы научились предвидеть появление и смерть галактик.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "d8f586ad403d484fc1eece19ee30dee175b142e9c72dcb82d4a5d333ad6247a2"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "5 / Мика",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Значит, вы умеете предсказывать будущее?",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "023aed45e817fccf320616b8e2ffb0e7f1b9d9d4766f5fca1a19cbe58c618fd3"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "6 / часы и рассвет",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Так же, как ты можешь предсказать, через сколько наступит рассвет, если знаешь, который сейчас час и во сколько взойдёт солнце.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "sha256": "86fc90c234b75f084f3c8ec930816f55cbf86aaafad3eba571254590b2c34b8d"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P02_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы научились рассчитывать рождение планет, солнечные затмения, движение планет, пролёты астероидов.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "26579f07b994638ce77d5b2e774eba3ea18d6c9d4d8f407ab404aa82cb931850"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Hello, Mika! We're glad you made it here. I'd like to tell you a little about us and what happened.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "2fd2543609f09a5000d90af1dc7cb1814e4d8334f32fe41b4fe667a3f432d63d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "When we first looked up at the sky, we began to notice patterns.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "9b3fad65dd001b97b2bcd41be3eb4720d995db06d0f4c7e6a8c2e8c01ee7a4b1"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "We built spaceships.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 1760,
      "sha256": "95d6a554c1a01452f473aaf9b0b823e816643b740257426e131eac529898c694"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "And began exploring the universe as we knew it.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3040,
      "sha256": "745202f61f1b70904ade7155c963597bd9137d42756f61511baeeae0e09dd815"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "4 / средние центральный и правый",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "We learned to foresee the birth and death of galaxies.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "170d3c0520a219e70d87d35f474457e203dc534abdb2a50b6923d91f83a5911c"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "5 / Мика",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "So you can predict the future?",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "sha256": "d21ff254ae1bc90b9bc2cc86358b9e6390656089642582e93ea87490ca15487f"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "6 / часы и рассвет",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Just as you can work out how long until sunrise if you know the time now and when the Sun will rise.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6080,
      "sha256": "f9b48af26ef4d0be4b48e9a3edfe8d461c142969ed28472f71105e2d0c229722"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P02_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "We learned to calculate the birth of planets, solar eclipses, the movement of planets, and passing asteroids.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "4cf06af3361fdbc74ba70a68dbf50839d07e2916277cc29cf7aad7af89014101"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Olá, Mika! Que bom que você chegou até nós. Quero te contar um pouco sobre nós e o que aconteceu.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6560,
      "sha256": "dbd300c266bad7617047f9740e8688d4d775f27c92f2b1e8e09eb379129fc29c"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Quando olhamos para o céu pela primeira vez, começamos a perceber padrões.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "42345cca3cb3b0155928f40cdc77e363145e66a13c6521c5a86888d2eefd91b4"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Construímos naves espaciais.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "f24c298b03da0ad732431f3fef8662698509602c0c645338fdb53645eec4b581"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "E começamos a explorar o Universo que conhecíamos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "15ba82d56ba2ee9f1ffb2c4f6f4cd1bf68f7d3464e813f3d774cc0eca30fcef7"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "4 / средние центральный и правый",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Aprendemos a prever o nascimento e a morte das galáxias.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "119c9b7ef9b4ca5503dd822a669482076d42159c7badb48a9076ef3b0e78f3cf"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
