      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "5 / Мика",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Então vocês conseguem prever o futuro?",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "786fc3084a444fee795a3ca8ab66f19c6f137bd8935f6ab23c1608fb884b9b51"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "6 / часы и рассвет",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Assim como você pode prever quanto falta para amanhecer se souber que horas são e a que horas o Sol vai nascer.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7040,
      "sha256": "4dd0fb2168e536d233f65a6e2df7fffb6ba90912c4d5c05be1852aef13b963cb"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P02_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Aprendemos a calcular o nascimento de planetas, os eclipses solares, o movimento dos planetas e a passagem de asteroides.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7680,
      "sha256": "a88fad011259cbeb450e253029aec17e5ae1c5823a154a3a4524202629388de1"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "¡Hola, Mika! Nos alegra que hayas llegado hasta aquí. Quiero contarte un poco sobre nosotros y lo que pasó.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "1bbc50208a58ddfea01ed20879e816d328e5a62385a06ef37c3192d31d24a8a6"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Cuando miramos al cielo por primera vez, empezamos a descubrir patrones.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "33ea57b0f21efbc29666b49fe237cda0b2a848c74ed0b87b66c349abd755c0a6"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Construimos naves espaciales.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "43de7b4467ea9cef8aa2adae7a71d64e2c7e1a613d11cabe5687c9f17490a108"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Y empezamos a recorrer el universo que conocíamos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "sha256": "145ffc40b4af92af0eef0938975ca29d3f169940644d7024a6ec84f00eeaa105"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
