      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Igual que tú puedes calcular cuánto falta para el amanecer si sabes qué hora es y a qué hora saldrá el Sol.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7040,
      "sha256": "95ccc313a2360c232d56e3cdd572e8828560db75297c9ae6975d8db8daa5a448"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P02_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Aprendimos a calcular el nacimiento de planetas, los eclipses solares, el movimiento de los planetas y el paso de asteroides.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "sha256": "cda7f3673cac8626886b3b4e801ad0ebca9d07824b14b5088172d0cedad05444"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Bonjour, Mika ! Nous sommes heureux que tu sois arrivé jusqu’à nous. Je voudrais te raconter un peu qui nous sommes et ce qui s’est passé.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "6081323afccda047f5265e3f9d21ce994bf26799cc3ef0ebb2aaa10b130530de"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Quand nous avons levé les yeux vers le ciel pour la première fois, nous avons commencé à voir des régularités.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "sha256": "074ce707cc90727951f861a73493593441a108b2cf721e03ef774493a2b85dd7"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous avons construit des vaisseaux spatiaux.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "31f9b0b0426e6c58faa5eab8317207862b58ae739fae24c5dfe9b51f2303c769"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Et nous avons commencé à parcourir l’Univers tel que nous le connaissions.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "a3408fa30e299db4fa97ec7f427dc9f13b1ee8b1387547c1894425ce37d83f73"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "4 / средние центральный и правый",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous avons appris à prévoir la naissance et la mort des galaxies.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "93267ea701509143a6b3eb4be41f57bd93523333aea73194d7c70246a79d1a7b"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "5 / Мика",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Alors, vous pouvez prédire l’avenir ?",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2480,
      "sha256": "f165f0247d22fb693ade6dbc596b03e816511218db14931de7da32e549784eb2"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "6 / часы и рассвет",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Comme toi, tu peux prévoir dans combien de temps le Soleil se lèvera si tu connais l’heure actuelle et celle du lever du Soleil.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "2c4b77cf3b8076fc0afabe1274f5598ffbe7baae1d7e7ec18b5d9b25c579a862"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P02_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous avons appris à calculer la naissance des planètes, les éclipses solaires, le mouvement des planètes et le passage des astéroïdes.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "5ba670c81c5962a2fbe84c99126676cd9089a1a3da891f090aca1d6f95866b65"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Hallo, Mika! Schön, dass du es zu uns geschafft hast. Ich möchte dir kurz von uns erzählen und davon, was geschehen ist.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "050f6bdf21a9e297c7f2f8c0325b2ad03656daebca1e803e43c589e0d7367eb0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "1 / верхний левый",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Als wir zum ersten Mal zum Himmel blickten, erkannten wir erste Muster.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "b6a6465fc738d079cb66d56742e582011d7b994f0fe8f755de27b0f8535b6842"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "2 / верхний правый",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Wir bauten Raumschiffe.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 1920,
      "sha256": "8d500ee92f37038f63f5176af846c2f090a0572e0d5e9908d6af8bd11a61c3de"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "3 / средний левый",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Und begannen, das uns bekannte Universum zu durchstreifen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "e737bc5dfdd0fbcb6f1f86e15819830e6c9e6f63e372cd5349b8139f68d0ba86"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "4 / средние центральный и правый",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Wir lernten, die Entstehung und das Ende von Galaxien vorherzusehen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "09ccd0c1122f932ecb13bd0a56d8a73f73b2b699cc3af87b33d7edfae8b74b8a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "5 / Мика",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Also könnt ihr die Zukunft vorhersagen?",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "3957a46c92445e209d78b4889f084c902e7cc322123d1607cdc075e417880ffd"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "6 / часы и рассвет",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "So wie du ausrechnen kannst, wie lange es bis zum Sonnenaufgang dauert, wenn du die Uhrzeit und den Zeitpunkt des Sonnenaufgangs kennst.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "7f9a7a9aa5d16d1dfd40a9b1261573df849943735014a6fe47177caaf0b39e43"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P02_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P02_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "7 / нижняя полоса, четыре изображения",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "telepathic_narration",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Wir lernten, die Entstehung von Planeten, Sonnenfinsternisse, die Bewegung der Planeten und Vorbeiflüge von Asteroiden zu berechnen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "adb59ef8d29cb1b1bf05a0f234dd970e13e4c4d347bcb8ff0827d12d4e650e4c"
    }
  ],
